[Event "Knight School"]
[Opening "Elephant Gambit"]
[Variation "Early Bishop Check"]
[ECO "C40"]
[Character "tactical"]
[Risk "medium"]
[EarlyMate "none"]
[Tricks "trap,hanging-piece"]
[Refutes "1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 d5 3. exd5 e4 4. Bb5+"]

1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 d5 3. exd5 e4 4. Bb5+? { A natural check, but it ignores the pawn that attacks the knight on f3. } 4... c6 { Attacks the bishop on b5 and keeps the pawn on e4 attacking the knight. White cannot save both pieces. [%cal Gc6b5,Ge4f3] }
5. dxc6 5... bxc6 { Recapturing with the b-pawn keeps the attack on the bishop. } 6. Ba4 6... exf3 { Wins the knight. } 7. Qxf3 7... Nf6 *
